Step - 0
Install .NET 10 SDK

Step - 1 (Scaffold the solution)
Create template "Solution File":
```
dotnet new sln -n IamEngine
```

Create template "ASP.NET Core Web API"
```
dotnet new webapi -n IamEngine.Api
```

Create template "Class Library"
```
dotnet new classlib -n IamEngine.Application
dotnet new classlib -n IamEngine.Domain
dotnet new classlib -n IamEngine.Infrastructure
dotnet new classlib -n IamEngine.Connectors.Abstractions
```

Add projects to solution:
```
dotnet sln add IamEngine.Api/IamEngine.Api.csproj IamEngine.Application/IamEngine.Application.csproj IamEngine.Domain/IamEngine.Domain.csproj IamEngine.Infrastructure/IamEngine.Infrastructure.csproj IamEngine.Connectors.Abstractions/IamEngine.Connectors.Abstractions.csproj
```

Add references to project:
```
dotnet add IamEngine.Application reference IamEngine.Domain
dotnet add IamEngine.Infrastructure reference IamEngine.Application
dotnet add IamEngine.Infrastructure reference IamEngine.Connectors.Abstractions
dotnet add IamEngine.Api reference IamEngine.Application
dotnet add IamEngine.Api reference IamEngine.Infrastructure
```

Step - 2 (Install Packages)
```
cd IamEngine.Api
dotnet add package Microsoft.Identity.Web
dotnet add package Microsoft.Identity.Web.MicrosoftGraph
dotnet add package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite
dotnet add package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Design
dotnet add package Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity.EntityFrameworkCore

cd ../IamEngine.Infrastructure
dotnet add package Microsoft.Graph
dotnet add package Azure.Identity
dotnet add package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore
```


Step - 3 (Store your credentials in user secrets)
```
cd ../IamEngine.Api
dotnet user-secrets init
dotnet user-secrets set "AzureAd:TenantId" "<paste your Tenant ID>"
dotnet user-secrets set "AzureAd:ClientId" "<paste your Client ID>"
dotnet user-secrets set "AzureAd:ClientSecret" "<paste your Client Secret value>"
```

Step - 4 (appsettings.json (non-secret config only))
```
// Append to IamEngine.Api/appsettings.json
{
  "AzureAd": {
    "Instance": "https://login.microsoftonline.com/",
    "CallbackPath": "/signin-oidc",
    "SignedOutCallbackPath": "/signout-callback-oidc"
  },
  "ConnectionStrings": {
    "Default": "Data Source=iamengine.db"
  }
}
```